// The declared 'a and 'b meet through the fn-typed param and the
// nested closure, and a rollback undoes the forward link one merge
// left, so the gated cell cannot be re-derived from the var at close.
// The gate holds the cells it counted. Both routes of both engines
// print the lambda.
|a: Array<'a>, f: fn(x: 'a) -> 'b| -> Array<'b> array::fold(a, [], |acc, v| array::push(a, f(v)))
